<title>POLAND: Zloty fixed flat at 0.73 pct from parity rate.</title>
<headline>Zloty fixed flat at 0.73 pct from parity rate.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.2890 to the dollar, down from 3.2860 on Monday and at 1.8850 to the mark, down from 1.8840, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at an average of 0.73 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, nearly flat from Monday's 0.74 percent fix.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
